OL,3,GNEWSAShops ordered to shut over illegal
OL,4,Atobacco and vape sales                 
OL,6,FThree convenience stores have been     
OL,7,Fordered to close for three months after
OL,8,Fundercover officers bought illegal     
OL,9,Ftobacco and vape products from them.   
OL,11,FOfficers from Lancashire County        
OL,12,FCouncil's Trading Standards team and   
OL,13,FLancashire Police made test purchases  
OL,14,Fat shops in St Annes, Barnoldswick and 
OL,15,FNelson.                                
OL,17,FThe Corner Shop in St Annes was also   
OL,18,Ffound to have employed underage        
OL,19,Fvolunteers in the store.               
OL,21,FTwo of the businesses had previously   
OL,22,Fbeen subject to closure orders.        
